  <Docs>
    <summary>Defines the parameters for Wi-Fi Proximity Detection (PD) ranging.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Defines the parameters for Wi-Fi Proximity Detection (PD) ranging.</para>
      <para>These parameters are used to configure a Wi-Fi PD ranging session. This includes specifying the peer device's MAC address, discovery channel, ranging role, and security credentials.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/ranging/wifi/pd/WifiPdRangingParams" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.ranging.wifi.pd.WifiPdRangingParams</code>.</a></format></para>
